#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:1
msgid "Prescriptions and medications"
msgstr "Prescriptions et médicaments"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:4
msgid ""
"Manage medication in Resthome — catalogue, prescriptions, administrations, "
"lots and stock, allergies and interactions."
msgstr ""
"Gérer la médication dans Resthome — catalogue, prescriptions, "
"administrations, lots et stock, allergies et interactions."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:8
msgid "How do I prescribe a medication in Resthome?"
msgstr "Comment prescrire un médicament dans Resthome ?"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:9
msgid ""
"From the resident's record in the Care app, create a prescription, then "
"choose the medication, the dosage and the period."
msgstr ""
"Depuis la fiche du résident dans l'application Soins, créez une "
"prescription, puis choisissez le médicament, la posologie et la période."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:11
msgid "Does Resthome check allergies and drug interactions?"
msgstr ""
"Resthome vérifie-t-il les allergies et les interactions médicamenteuses ?"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:12
msgid ""
"Yes. Resthome knows the resident's allergies and the known interactions, and"
" warns you when a prescription poses a risk - before administration."
msgstr ""
"Oui. Resthome connaît les allergies du résident et les interactions connues,"
" et vous avertit lorsqu'une prescription présente un risque — avant "
"l'administration."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:14
msgid "What can I do with an ongoing prescription?"
msgstr "Que puis-je faire d'une prescription en cours ?"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:15
msgid ""
"You can suspend it temporarily (before an examination for instance), resume "
"it, end it at the end of treatment, or cancel one entered by mistake."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez la suspendre temporairement (avant un examen par exemple), la "
"reprendre, la terminer en fin de traitement, ou annuler celle saisie par "
"erreur."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:17
msgid "How is medication administration traced?"
msgstr "Comment l'administration des médicaments est-elle tracée ?"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:18
msgid ""
"Administrations stem from the prescriptions: the caregiver records what was "
"given, when and by whom, which makes traceability complete."
msgstr ""
"Les administrations découlent des prescriptions : le soignant enregistre ce "
"qui a été donné, quand et par qui, ce qui rend la traçabilité complète."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:20
msgid "Where does the medication catalogue come from?"
msgstr "D'où vient le catalogue des médicaments ?"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:21
msgid ""
"From the Belgian SAM database, which provides the name, form and dosage of "
"each medication and serves as the source for prescriptions."
msgstr ""
"De la base belge SAM, qui fournit le nom, la forme et le dosage de chaque "
"médicament et sert de source aux prescriptions."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:24
msgid ""
"Resthome manages a resident's **medication** end to end: from prescription "
"to administration, including stock and safety checks (allergies, "
"interactions)."
msgstr ""
"Resthome gère la **médication** d'un résident de bout en bout : de la "
"prescription à l'administration, en passant par le stock et les contrôles de"
" sécurité (allergies, interactions)."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:27
msgid "The medication catalogue"
msgstr "Le catalogue de médicaments"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:29
msgid ""
"Available medications are grouped in a **catalogue** (linked to the Belgian "
"**SAM** database). It lists the name, the form and the dosage. It is the "
"source of prescriptions."
msgstr ""
"Les médicaments disponibles sont regroupés dans un **catalogue** (relié à la"
" base belge **SAM**). Vous y retrouvez le nom, la forme, le dosage. C'est la"
" source des prescriptions."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:33
msgid "Prescribing"
msgstr "Prescrire"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:35
msgid ""
"From the resident's record (Care application), create a **prescription**."
msgstr ""
"Depuis la fiche du résident (application Soins), créez une **prescription**."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:36
msgid "Choose the **medication**, the **dosage** and the **period**."
msgstr "Choisissez le **médicament**, la **posologie** et la **période**."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:37
msgid "**Save.**"
msgstr "**Enregistrez.**"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:39
msgid "A prescription follows its life cycle with clear actions:"
msgstr "Une prescription suit son cycle de vie avec des actions claires :"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:41
msgid "**Suspend** — temporarily interrupt (e.g. before an examination)."
msgstr "**Suspendre** — interrompre temporairement (ex. avant un examen)."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:42
msgid "**Resume** — restart a suspended prescription."
msgstr "**Reprendre** — relancer une prescription suspendue."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:43
msgid "**End** — close at the end of the treatment."
msgstr "**Terminer** — clôturer à la fin du traitement."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:44
msgid "**Cancel** — remove a prescription entered by mistake."
msgstr "**Annuler** — supprimer une prescription saisie par erreur."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:46
msgid "Safety: allergies and interactions"
msgstr "Sécurité : allergies et interactions"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:49
msgid ""
"Resthome knows the resident's **allergies** and the known **drug "
"interactions**. It warns you if a prescription poses a risk — a safeguard "
"before administration."
msgstr ""
"Resthome connaît les **allergies** du résident et les **interactions "
"médicamenteuses** connues. Il vous alerte si une prescription pose un risque"
" — un garde-fou avant l'administration."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:53
msgid "Administering"
msgstr "Administrer"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:55
msgid ""
"**Administrations** stem from prescriptions: the caregiver records what was "
"given, when and by whom. Traceability is complete."
msgstr ""
"Les **administrations** découlent des prescriptions : le soignant enregistre"
" ce qui a été donné, quand, et par qui. La traçabilité est complète."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:58
msgid "Hospitalisation: suspend, then resume"
msgstr "Hospitalisation : suspendre, puis reprendre"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:60
msgid ""
"When a resident goes to hospital, their prescriptions must not stay active —"
" the hospital takes over. Resthome does it in one step."
msgstr ""
"Quand un résident part à l'hôpital, ses prescriptions ne doivent pas rester "
"actives — l'hôpital prend le relais. Resthome le fait en une étape."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:63
msgid "From the resident's record, open the **hospitalisation** action."
msgstr "Depuis la fiche du résident, ouvrez l'action **hospitalisation**."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:64
msgid "Choose **Hospitalise**, and enter the **date** and the **reason**."
msgstr ""
"Choisissez **Hospitaliser**, et saisissez la **date** et le **motif**."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:65
msgid ""
"Confirm: every **active** prescription is **suspended**, each one carrying "
"the date and the reason."
msgstr ""
"Validez : chaque prescription **active** est **suspendue**, en portant la "
"date et le motif."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:68
msgid ""
"On the way back, the same action in **Return** mode **resumes** the "
"prescriptions that had been suspended for this hospitalisation."
msgstr ""
"Au retour, la même action en mode **Retour** **reprend** les prescriptions "
"suspendues pour cette hospitalisation."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:71
msgid "The liaison pack"
msgstr "Le dossier de liaison"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:73
msgid ""
"Before the resident leaves, print the **liaison pack**: the document the "
"hospital asks for on admission. It gathers what the ward needs — identity, "
"treatments, allergies, dependency, and the hospitalisation preferences "
"recorded in the [anamnesis](anamnese.md)."
msgstr ""
"Avant le départ du résident, imprimez le **dossier de liaison** : le "
"document que l'hôpital demande à l'admission. Il rassemble ce dont le "
"service a besoin — identité, traitements, allergies, dépendance, et les "
"préférences d'hospitalisation consignées dans l'[anamnèse](anamnese.md)."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:78
msgid "One click, at the right moment"
msgstr "Un clic, au bon moment"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:81
msgid ""
"The pack is printed from the hospitalisation window itself, so it is "
"produced while the transfer is being recorded — not looked for afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Le dossier s'imprime depuis la fenêtre d'hospitalisation elle-même : il est "
"donc produit pendant l'enregistrement du transfert — pas cherché après coup."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:85
msgid "Lots and stock"
msgstr "Lots et stock"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:87
msgid ""
"The **medication lots** and the **stock withdrawals** let you track the "
"available quantities and consumption, with lot numbers for traceability."
msgstr ""
"Les **lots de médicaments** et les **sorties de stock** permettent de suivre"
" les quantités disponibles et la consommation, avec les numéros de lot pour "
"la traçabilité."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:90
msgid "Useful configuration"
msgstr "Configuration utile"

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:92
msgid "**Pathologies (ICD-10)** — the resident's history and diagnoses."
msgstr "**Pathologies (CIM-10)** — antécédents et diagnostics du résident."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:93
msgid "**Allergens** — known allergies."
msgstr "**Allergènes** — allergies connues."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:94
msgid "**Drug interactions** — vigilance rules."
msgstr "**Interactions médicamenteuses** — règles de vigilance."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:95
msgid "**SAM database** — reference catalogue of Belgian medications."
msgstr "**Base SAM** — référentiel des médicaments belges."

#: ../../content/soins/prescriptions.md:97
msgid "Going further"
msgstr "Pour aller plus loin"

